- 1: Walking skeleton — depends on none — S1 · R1
- 2: Batteries — depends on 1 — S2 · R2, E1
- 3: Nested groups — depends on 1, 2 — S3 · R3
Issue: new — Shared site limit
Confirm: nothing flagged
Approving will:
- file the epic issue
- file 3 slice issues in order and link them from the epic
- clean up — no code, no worktree
Answer: approve · change <what> · stop
user: approve
